OL,3,GNEWSATwo stations to close during rail
OL,4,Aroute upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the main railway line
OL,7,Fbetween Leeds and Manchester will close
OL,8,Fon Saturday for 16 days and cause
OL,9,Fsignificant disruption for passengers.
OL,11,FAs part of the latest phase of the
OL,12,FTranspennine Route Upgrade, both
OL,13,FHuddersfield and Slaithwaite stations
OL,14,Fwill close completely and buses will
OL,15,Freplace trains.
OL,17,FServices between the two major cities
OL,18,Fwill be diverted via Brighouse on the
OL,19,FCalder Valley line.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
