OL,3,GNEWSATwo stations to close during rail
OL,4,Aroute upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Sumner from Transpennine Route
OL,7,FUpgrade said: "We've had to balance
OL,8,Fwhen to keep trains running and when to
OL,9,Fclose the railway so that we can carry
OL,10,Fout complex engineering work in a safe
OL,11,Fworking environment."
